    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Hot Spot"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new film from the acclaimed director of The Silent Twins is a daring and distinctive sci-fi thriller set in a near-future society ruled by sentient AI."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/rogue-trooper-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Rogue Trooper"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Duncan Jones brings the beloved 2000 AD comic strip to life with an all-guns-blazing sci-fi animation, about a soldier in a dystopian future who is sent on an impossible mission."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/wildwood-02.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Wildwood"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A forest inhabited by magical beings is the setting for this epic stop-motion saga from LAIKA Studios."
    }
